DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/2xepmt3a\n\nAdd
 ress:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nEvery few weeks, social media
  erupts into a familiar (these days) firestorm: an autonomous agent demons
 trates introspective behavior, an LLM claims an inner life, and the tech w
 orld splits into warring camps. Half the timeline dismisses it as cheap au
 tocomplete (stochastic parrot); the other half wonders if we have stumbled
  into synthetic sentience. But understanding consciousness is neither a ma
 rketing milestone nor a mere engineering parameter; it is a civilizational
 -level goal. As we race toward autonomous AI, our civilization faces an un
 precedented asymmetric shock: we possess exponential…\n\nHosted by Team 
 Lossfunk, Host 2 Quill & Host 3 Quill
