 s: Who do we hire first to build the machine? A wrong move here doesn't ju
 st cost money—it costs months of momentum. This month, we are breaking d
 own the blueprint for your initial Go-To-Market team:\nThe First 5 Sales H
 ires: Should They Be Closers, SDRs, or Technical Experts?\nThere is no "on
 e-size-fits-all" for your first five hires. Depending on your ACV, product
  complexity, and market, your dream team might look like 3 SDRs—or it mi
 ght look like 2 Sales Engineers and a Customer Success lead. We’re figur
 ing…\n\nHosted by Host 5 Quill, Host 6 Quill & Host 7 Quill
