SUMMARY:Code Meets Animation - Bangalore
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/okk23geo\n\nAdd
 ress:\nZepto HQ Bangalore\nBengaluru, India\n\nWhen Code Meets Animation\n
 AI can now turn a single sentence into a production-ready animation. That 
 part is getting easy. The hard part is everything that comes after: keepin
 g motion consistent across a product, turning it into a system with tokens
  and rules, making sure it performs on every device, and actually shipping
  it.\nThat gap is what Code Meets Animation is about, and it's what we're 
 digging into for an evening in Bangalore.\nLottieFiles is teaming up with 
 Zepto and Friends of Figma Bangalore for a night of talks, a hands-on live
  challenge, and plenty of time to meet people building…\n\nHosted by Lot
 tie Community & 3 others
